]](/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection)\n\n### Message Sent!\n\nThank you for reaching out. Our team will get back to you within 24 hours.\n\n ","images":[]},{"url":"https://blox.xyz/projects/paradigm-anantaara","title":"Paradigm Anantaara In Borivali West | Buy 2 BHK, 2 & 3 BHK WITH DECK in Mumbai","raw_content":"![Blox Logo](/assets/images/blox-logo-white.svg)\n\n![user-primary](/assets/icons/user-primary.svg)\n\n![arrow-down-primary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-primary.svg)\n\nDiscover. Experience. Buy.\n\nGet Personalized experience\n\nby logging in\n\nLogin / Register\n\n[Properties in Mumbai](/buy/mumbai/1a256)\n\n>\n\n[Properties in Borivali West](/buy/mumbai/borivali-west-1a256b7a21)\n\n>\n\nParadigm Realty\n\n>\n\n![share-primary](/assets/icons/share-primary.svg)\n\n![compare-inactive-secondary](/assets/icons/compare-inactive-secondary.svg)\n\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/paradigm-realty-paradigm-anantaara-1747641591.jpg)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/paradigm-realty-paradigm-anantaara-elevation-1732782075.webp)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/paradigm-realty-paradigm-anantaara-elevation-1732782160.webp)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/paradigm-realty-paradigm-anantaara-elevation-1732782199.webp)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/paradigm-realty-paradigm-anantaara-swimming-pool-1732782384.webp)VIEW ALL\n\n![Propert-Icon](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/201221111027-PARADIGM.png)\n\n# Paradigm Anantaara\n\nParadigm Anantaara, Experience Centre, Next to Shimpoli, Shimpoli, Borivali West, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400092\n\nBorivali West\n\n₹2.28 Cr - 3.71 Cr\n\n₹2.28 Cr - 3.71 Cr\n\nBOOK PROPERTY\n\n[Price & Floor Plan](#Price & Floor Plan)\n\n![video-primary](/assets/icons/video-primary.svg)\n\n![call-rm](/assets/icons/call-rm.svg)\n\n![calendar-primary](/assets/icons/calendar-primary.svg)\n\nBOOK PROPERTY\n\n## Overview\n\nParadigm Anantaara, residential project in Borivali West by Paradigm Realty, offers premium 2 & 3 BHK spacious homes designed for elevated urban living. This luxurious real estate development features a beautifully landscaped podium that delivers a serene, elegant lifestyle experience with numerous modern amenities. Residents can enjoy podium-level leisure spaces at 135 ft. above ground, including a fully equipped gym, indoor games zone & a private mini-theatre. For an unmatched lifestyle, the Skydeck at 475 ft. offers an infinity sky pool, panoramic parkside views & an exclusive viewing deck to enjoy the iconic Pagoda sunset. Paradigm Anantaara brings together luxury, comfort & premium amenities in one of Borivali West’s most sought-after residential locations.\n\n2 BHK, 3 BHK\n\nUnder construction\n\nPossession in Dec 2030\n\nAvg. Price\n\n₹32,619/sq.ft\n\nRERA Carpet Area\n\n699 - 1240 sqft\n\nWhy consider buying this property?\n\n* Premium residential project in Borivali West by Paradigm Realty.\n* Elegantly designed landscaped podium with serene lifestyle spaces.\n* State-of-the-art gym, indoor games zone & private mini-theatre.\n* Stunning infinity sky pool with panoramic parkside views.\n* Strategic location with excellent connectivity in Borivali West.\n\n* Spacious and well-planned 2 & 3 BHK luxury homes.\n* Podium-level amenities located 135 ft. above ground.\n* Spectacular Skydeck at 475 ft. offering a premium lifestyle experience.\n* Exclusive viewing deck to enjoy the iconic Pagoda sunset.\n\n## Google AI Summary\n\n✦\n\nOnline reviews for Paradigm Anantaara in Borivali West highlight its focus on spacious layouts and high-altitude living, with many users appreciating the premium feel and the connectivity to the metro. While the project is praised for its design and unobstructed views, some concerns have been raised regarding the high occupancy density and the premium pricing.\n\n![up-thumb](/assets/icons/up-thumb.svg)\n\n### The good things\n\nSpacious Layouts\n\nThe apartments feature expansive carpet areas and dedicated walk-in wardrobe spaces which are rare in the local market.\n\nTransit Connectivity\n\nThe project is located within 550 meters of the Shimpoli Metro Station and under 2 km from Borivali Railway Station.\n\nUnique Architecture\n\nThe first habitable floor starts at 150 feet above ground, ensuring better air quality and privacy from street noise.\n\nUnobstructed Views\n\nResidents on higher floors enjoy 360-degree views of the Sanjay Gandhi National Park, the creek, and the Pagoda.\n\nGenerous Balconies\n\nEach unit includes large, functional balconies that enhance the living space and ventilation.\n\nModern Amenities\n\nThe project includes high-end facilities like a sky-deck infinity pool, a mini theatre, and a double-height designer lobby.\n\n![down-thumb](/assets/icons/down-thumb.svg)\n\n### Needs improvement\n\nCongestion Risk\n\nSome reviewers expressed concern that the high number of units per floor may lead to overcrowding in common areas and elevators.\n\nPremium Pricing\n\nThe cost per square foot is noted to be on the higher side compared to older developments in the Shimpoli area.\n\nTraffic Bottlenecks\n\nThe surrounding internal roads near Shimpoli can experience heavy congestion during peak hours.\n\nConstruction Timeline\n\nAs an under-construction project, some buyers have expressed typical anxieties regarding the final possession dates.\n\n---\n\nThe Verdict\n\nGreat for families\n\nGood for luxury seekers\n\nExcellent for metro commuters\n\nHigh value for space-conscious buyers\n\nAvoid if looking for low-density living\n\n## Amenities\n\n![amenities/gym-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/gym-secondary.svg)\n\nGymnasium\n\n![amenities/indoor-games-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/indoor-games-secondary.svg)\n\nIndoor Games\n\n![amenities/jogging-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/jogging-secondary.svg)\n\nJogging / Cycle Track\n\n![amenities/kids-play-areas-seco