ing Area, Well Designed Entrance Lobby, Yoga Area.\n\n### Who is the developer of Paradigm Anantaara?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe developer of Paradigm Anantaara is Paradigm Realty.\n\n## About The Developer\n\n![Developer for Paradigm Anantaara:Paradigm Realty](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/201221111027-PARADIGM.png)\n\n## Paradigm Realty\n\nParadigm Realty is a reputable Real Estate Development company, dedicated to delivering top-quality residential properties. With impeccable efficiency and remarkable management, they are poised for success in Real Estate development. Their dedicated and experienced team of architects and workers work tirelessly to ensure projects are delivered on time. Their ultimate goal is to see their customers happy and satisfied by providing dream homes equipped with all the modern amenities and features\n\n## Properties In The Same Area\n\n![bloxsquare](/assets/icons/bloxsquare.svg)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/konark-developer-konark-32-west-view-elevation-1779782095.webp)\n\n![Konark 32 West View](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/150923041604-newproject-3.webp)\n\nKonark 32 West View\n\nBorivali West\n\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n\n![phone-ring-primary](/assets/icons/phone-ring-primary.webp)\n\n₹3.35 Cr - 7.71 Cr\n\n2, 3, 4.5 BHK\n\nBOOK A VISIT\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/dotom-realty-dotom-vue-elevation-1747896338.jpg)\n\n![Dotom Vue](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/111125030803-dotommvlogo.webp)\n\nDotom Vue\n\nBorivali West\n\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n\n![phone-ring-primary](/assets/icons/phone-ring-primary.webp)\n\n₹95 L - 1.5 Cr\n\n1, 2 BHK\n\nBOOK A VISIT\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/dgs-group-builders-dgs-sheetal-shashank-elevation-1754035295.jpg)\n\n![DGS Sheetal Shashank](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/230822105140-newproject-2022-08-23t105