-5crores-1a256b7a21b9a500)\n* [Properties between 2 Cr - 3 Cr in Borivali West](https://blox.xyz/buy/mumbai/borivali-west-2crores-3crores-1a256b7a21b8a200b9a300)\n* [Properties between 3 Cr - 5 Cr in Borivali West](https://blox.xyz/buy/mumbai/borivali-west-3crores-5crores-1a256b7a21b8a300b9a500)\n\n## Projects by construction status in Borivali West, Mumbai\n\n* [Under construction properties in Borivali West](https://blox.xyz/buy/mumbai/under-construction-borivali-west-1a256b6a1b7a21)\n* [Ready to move properties in Borivali West](https://blox.xyz/buy/mumbai/ready-to-move-borivali-west-1a256b6a2b7a21)\n\n[![Blox Logo](/assets/images/blox-logo-white.svg)](/)\n\n### OVERVIEW\n\n* [About Us](/about)\n* [Contact Us](/contact)\n* [Careers](/careers)\n* [Terms & Conditions](/terms-conditions)\n* [Privacy Policy](/privacy)\n\n### EXPLORE\n\n* [Developers](/developers)\n* [Blogs](/blogs)\n* [Press Mentions](/press-mentions)\n* [EMI Calculator](/calculator/emi-calculator-homeloan)\n\n### CITIES WE SERVE\n\n* [Kolkata](/kolkata)\n* [Mumbai](/)\n* [Navi Mumbai](/navi-mumbai)\n* [Pune](/pune)\n* [Thane](/thane)\n* [Alibaug](/alibaug)\n* [Bangalore](/bangalore)\n* [Noida](/noida)\n* [Palghar](/palghar)\n* [Raigad](/raigad)\n* [Telangana](/telangana)\n\n### FOLLOW US\n\n[![facebook-primary](/assets/icons/facebook-primary.svg)](https://www.facebook.com/blox.xyz/)[![instagram-primary](/assets/icons/instagram-primary.svg)](https://www.instagram.com/blox.xyz/)[![linkedin-primary](/assets/icons/linkedin-primary.svg)](https://www.linkedin.com/company/blox-xyz/mycompany/)[![twitter-x-primary](/assets/icons/twitter-x-primary.svg)](https://twitter.com/blox_xyz)[![youtube-primary](/assets/icons/youtube-primary.svg)](https://www.youtube.com/@BloxPropTech)[![mail-primary](/assets/icons/mail-primary.svg)\n\nEmail us at:](mailto:hello@blox.xyz)\n\n---\n\nMumbai H/O\n\nRERA ID : A51900029429\n\nMethod & Madness Technology Pvt. Ltd., Unit No. 1202, 12th floor, One International Center, Tower-3, Senapati Bapat Marg, Mumbai, Maharashtra - 400013\n\nRERA ID : A51900029429\n\nOffice no 303, Platinum Square, Sakore Nagar, Viman Nagar, Pune, Maharashtra - 411014\n\nRERA ID : WBRERA/A/NOR/2026/000949\n\nOffice no : 7W84C, 7th Floor, West Block, Mani Casadona, Plot No. IIF/04, Action Area- IIF, Newtown, Kolkata, West Bengal - 700160\n\n---\n\n© Copyright 2026Blox.xyz","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.propertypistol.com/projects/paradigm-anantaara-borivali-west-pid-14280","title":"Paradigm Anantaara in Borivali West, Mumbai - Price, Brochure, Floor Plan, Location","raw_content":"1. [Home](/)\n2. /\n3. [Mumbai](/mumbai)\n4. /\n5. [Flats for sale in Mumbai](/mumbai/buy/flats-for-sale-in-mumbai)\n6. /\n7. [New Projects in Mumbai](/mumbai/buy/new-projects-in-mumbai)\n8. /\n9. [New Projects in Borivali West](/mumbai/buy/real-estate-projects-in-borivali-west)\n10. /\n11. Paradigm Anantaara\n\n# Paradigm Anantaara\n\nFlats by **[Paradigm Realty](/mumbai/buy/projects-by-paradigm-realty)** at Paradigm Anantaara - Shimpoli, Borivali (W), next to Shimpoli Ground, Shimpoli, Borivali West, Mumbai, Maharashtra, India\n\nRERA\n\nP51800034854\n\nAgent RERA - A51700000043\n\nINR3.97 Cr\n\nOnwards\n\nZero Brokerage\n\nBest Price Guarantee\n\nZero Brokerage\n\nBest Price Guarantee\n\nINR3.97 Cr\n\nOnwards\n\nConfigurations3 BHK, 3.5 BHK, 6 BHK\n\nPossession DateDec 2030\n\nBuilt up AreaOn request\n\nCarpet Area1,133 - 2,523\n\n* Sq.ft\n* Sq.yrd\n* Sq.mtr\n* Acres\n\nMin. Price per Sqft.INR 35.04 K per Sqft.\n\n[![Paradigm Anantaara Floor Plan]()](https://s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/website-prod-public/files/4803/original/AnantaaraFloorPlans-13.jpg?1698428787)\n\n[![Paradigm Anantaara Floor Plan]()](https://s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/website-prod-public/files/4804/original/AnantaaraFloorPlans-14.jpg?1698428787)\n\n[![Paradigm Anantaara Apartment 3 BHK]()](https://s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/website-prod-public/two_d_plans/44299/original/3b.PNG?1764404971)[![Paradigm Anantaara Apartment 3 BHK]()](https://s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/website-prod-public/two_d_plans/44298/original/3b.PNG?1764404971)[![Paradigm Anantaara Apartment 3 BHK]()](https://s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/website-prod-public/two_d_plans/114406/original/3b.png?1774509975)\n\n[![Rera Kerala]()https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/](https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/)\n\nP51800034854\n\nScan QR code to view RERA details","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.propjunction.in/projects/paradigm-anantaara","title":"Paradigm Anantaara at Shimpoli, Borivali West, Mumbai","raw_content":"![Paradigm Anantaara Logo](https://cms.propjunction.com/Project/Project_Logo/1812/Thumb/1812.png)\n\n# Paradigm Anantaara at Borivali By Paradigm Realty Borivali West, Mumbai\n\n## Project Summary\n\n## INR 2.28 Cr.\n\n|  |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| [Project StatusProject StatusNew Launch](/new-launch-projects) | [Paradigm RealtyPayment PlanEasy Instalments](/projects/paradigm-anantaara-price-list) | Announcing - SoonPossessionAnnouncing - Soon |\n| [ApartmentProperty TypeApartment](/apartment-for-sale) | [2, 3 & 4 BedroomsBedroom2, 3 & 4 Bedrooms](/projects/paradigm-anantaara-floor-plan) | Various Sizes AvailableSize Range Various Sizes Available |\n\n![Project Status](/projects/images/status.webp)\n![Paradigm Realty](/projects/images/builder.webp)\n![Announcing - Soon](/projects/images/date.webp)\n![Apartment](/projects/images/type.webp)\n![2, 3 & 4 Bedrooms](/projects/images/bedroom.webp)\n![Various Sizes Available](/projects/images/size.webp)\n\n## Overview\n\n**Paradigm Anantaara** is a timeless elegant residential epitome at **Shimpoli, Borivali West in Mumbai** with splendid **2, 3, & 4-bedroom apartments** by **Paradigm Realty**. Welcome to the contemporary spaces that deliver the immaculate and exceptional living needs of families. Witness the panoramic 360-degree vistas of the national park, the flowing Gorai Creek, & the Pagoda. Access the bespoke lifestyle at comfortable homes and world-class amenities within this artfully derived architectural masterpiece.\n\nThis 42-storey rising cornerstone is the premium living benchmark of the community. With innovative detailing and subtly carved sophistication, it’s a branded gem that adorns the open skyline amidst the lush landscapes of the community.\n\nImmerse in the joy of a lifestyle that elevates you above the ordinary, allowing you to taste the premium distinctions of daily life. Discover amenities in the open and serene skyline, where every experience discovers its unique essence. The Saint-Tropez is the podium level on the 10th floor, featuring recreational, fitness, leisure, playful and gathering areas including yoga, exercise, & fitness centre, a kid’s play area, an indoor games room, a mini theatre, a salon, banquets, & multipurpose rooms.\n\nThe Aura Sky facilities are exclusively incorporated for its elite inhabitants. The breathtaking viewing deck with plunging up in the infinity pool is an expensive leisure for people. Based on the global metropolis, this rooftop area aims to deliver a soothing quality indulgence with the feeling of serenity and relaxation. At 475 ft above the ground, this amenity caters to the modern desires and luxurious convenience of the inhabitants.\n\n### Key Highlights\n\n## Thank You for your enquiry ! We will get back to you shortly...\n\n![Please wait...](/images/loading.gif)\n\n### Get in touch with us!\n\n## Amenities\n\nTons of attractions and facilities at services for an enhanced lifestyle.\n\n![](/projects/images/clientloader.webp)\n![](/projects/images/clientloader.webp)\n![](/projects/images/clientloader.webp)\n![](/projects/images/clientloader.webp)\n![](/projects/images/clientloader.webp)\n![](/projects/images/clientloader.webp)\n![](/projects/images/clientloader.webp)\n![](/projects/images/clientloader.webp)\n![](/projects/images/clientloader.webp)\n![](/projects/images/clientloader.webp)\n![](/projects/images/clientloader.webp)\n![](/projects/images/clientloader.webp)\n![](/projects/images/clientloader.webp)\n![](/projects/images/clientloader.webp)\n![](/projects/images/clientloader.webp)\n\n## Price List\n\n## Floor Plan\n\n## 6 Bedrooms\n\n![6 BHK, Unit 3 & 4](https://cms.propjunction.com/Project/Floor_Image/1812/thumb/28258.webp)\n![Floor Plan](/projects/images/view-floorplan.webp)\n\n## 5 Bedrooms\n\n![5.5 BHK, Unit 7 & 8](https://cms.propjunction.com/Project/Floor_Image/1812/thumb/28257.webp)\n![Floor Plan](/projects/images/view-floorplan.webp)\n\n## 3 Bedrooms\n\n![3.5 BHK, Unit 1 & 2](https://cms.propjunction.com/Project/Floor_Image/1812/thumb/28255.webp)\n![Floor Plan](/projects/images/view-floorplan.webp)\n\n## 3 Bedrooms\n\n![3.5 BHK, Unit 5 & 6](https://cms.propjunction.com/Project/Floor_Image/1812/thumb/28256.webp)\n![Floor Plan](/projects/images/view-floorplan.webp)\n\n## Location\n\n![Paradigm Anantaara Location Map](/projects/images/clientloader.webp)\n\n**The Paradigm Anantaara** is promoting a delightful living opportunity at **Shimpoli in Borivali West, Mumbai**. This is the nature-inspired suburban district filled with lush landscape and vibrant surroundings. This community promotes an ideal way of lifestyle for families by offering international schools, malls, hospitals, cultural attractions, and modes of transportation including railway & metro stations and highways. Many commercial and entertainment-focused hubs for professionals are also within a nearby range.\n\n### Location Connectivity\n\n## Master Plan\n\nFind your heaven-like sanctuary at the **master-planned** home address of **Anantaara Paradigm** in **Shimpoli at Borivali West**. This 42-storey majestic tower features extravagant living spaces and thoughtfully designed additional areas with premium quality facilities. The Club Saint Tropez podium on the 10th floor and the Aura Sky rooftop amenity centre are prestigious spaces brimming with world-class facilities catering to the needs and utmost leisure of every age group of residents.\n\nFind your heaven-like sanctuary at the **master-planned** home address of **Anantaara Paradigm** in **Shimpoli at Borivali West**. This 42-storey majestic tower features extravagant living spaces and thoughtfully designed additional areas with premium quality facilities. The Club Saint Tropez podium on the 10th floor and the Aura Sky rooftop amenity centre are prestigious spaces brimming with world-class facilities catering to the needs and utmost leisure of every age group of residents.\n\n![](/projects/images/clientloader.webp)\n![](/projects/images/clientloader.webp)\n![](/projects/images/clientloader.webp)\n![](/projects/images/clientloader.webp)\n![](/projects/images/clientloader.webp)\n![](/projects/images/clientloader.webp)\n![](/projects/images/clientloader.webp)\n![](/projects/images/clientloader.webp)\n![](/projects/images/clientloader.webp)\n![](/projects/images/clientloader.webp)\n![](/projects/images/clientloader.webp)\n![](/projects/images/clientloader.webp)\n![Paradigm Anantaara Master Plan](https://cms.propjunction.com/Project/LayoutPlan/1812/Gallery/1823.webp)\n\n## Project Gallery\n\n![Cafeteria](https://cms.propjunction.com/Gallery/1812/Thumb/16528.webp)\n![Infinity Pool](https://cms.propjunction.com/Gallery/1812/Thumb/16531.webp)\n![Indoor Games](https://cms.propjunction.com/Gallery/1812/Thumb/16533.webp)\n![Lobby](https://cms.propjunction.com/Gallery/1812/Thumb/16535.webp)\n![Well Equipped Gym](https://cms.propjunction.com/Gallery/1812/Thumb/16536.webp)\n![Retail Lifestyle](https://cms.propjunction.com/Gallery/1812/Thumb/16538.webp)\n![Master Bedroom](https://cms.propjunction.com/Gallery/1812/Thumb/16534.webp)\n![Wide Open Window](https://cms.propjunction.com/Gallery/1812/Thumb/16529.webp)\n![Kids Playing Area](https://cms.propjunction.com/Gallery/1812/Thumb/16532.webp)\n![Amazing View](https://cms.propjunction.com/Gallery/1812/Thumb/16539.webp)\n![True Family Living](https://cms.propjunction.com/Gallery/1812/Thumb/16530.webp)\n![Entrance](https:/